  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "Add a built-in dissector for ZMTP",
  "description": "Meant as a replacement for the popular Lua dissector that may be found at https://github.com/whitequark/zmtp-wireshark\n\nPreserves \"zmtp.protocol\" dissector table for TCP port -> dissector, and also adds a UAT for setting (or overriding these choice) as a dissector preference.\n\nHas been tested with some private captures, as well as a loopback capture taken while running libzmq tests.",
